ayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]你太看得起自己，也太看得起我了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]贫民街的问题可没那么容易解决。其次……我在这里是有那么点号召力，但我终究是一个小角色而已，怎么可能把这么复杂的情况归纳成什么“最大的问题”。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"有人说你知道。","tag":"tag_7"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[cm][show]谁？谁在胡说八道？[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_42"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"display\": true,\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"uid\": \"lbe_c3_area4_1\"\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcDisplay\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_43"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 3,\r    \"npc\": \"lbe_c3_area4_1\",\r    \"direction\": 2,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"walk_front\",\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"points\": [\r      {\r        \"y\": -20.00,\r        \"x\": -7.00\r      }\r    ],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_44"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"time":1800,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]好久不见了……伊曼纽尔。是我告诉他们的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]啧。原来是你。怎么从大市集回来了，这太阳是从西边出来了吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]这里也算是我的老家，我怎么就不能回来了？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]哎哟，这次是专门回老家怀念过往吗？真是辛苦了，我尊敬的哥哥。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哥……哥哥？你们是兄妹吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]呵，那是很久以前的事情了。当时四指镇还在，一对兄妹住在那里。他们从小相依为命，后来一个人去了大市集过上好日子，一个人留在了贫民街受穷。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]那是很久以前的事情了。我这次回来可不是为了怀念过去，我是埃迪蒂小姐派来援助贫民街的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]埃迪蒂？啊，是那个凶巴巴的治安队长啊。我记得她也是从四指镇出来的吧。看来我们四指镇真是有福气啊，竟然出了两个能坐到大市集高位的人才。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]好了，说回正事吧。我知道你一直在为改善贫民街而努力，请把最困难的问题告诉我吧，我会想办法帮你的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]原来你是认真的？这是你的意思还是大市集的意思？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]既是我的意思，也是大市集的意思，纠结这个有必要吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]当然有必要了。如果是你个人的意思，那你根本帮不上忙；如果是大市集的意思，那就看你们舍得付出多少了。这么说你懂了吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]至少，告诉我目前最大的麻烦。我会从那里开始，一步一步得到你的信任。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]目前最大的麻烦，肯定是徘徊在附近的魔爪蛇。虽然那些魔物不会进入贫民街，但它们经常在野外袭击过路的居民，导致里面的人不敢出去，外面的人不敢进来。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]自从大市集加派治安队的人手后，情况确实好了不少，但也仅限于此了。治安队只能守着贫民街的几个重要通道，大家每天还是提心吊胆地过日子。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]呃……我还以为会有很麻烦的事情要处理，最大的问题只是蛇怪吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]不管贫民街还有什么其他问题，安全问题才是最重要的吧。如果自己的安全都没法保障的话，谁会有心思去谈发展呢？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]确实……贫民街附近的魔物数量不容忽略。你们有找到原因吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]就在前几天，我派手下的人去周边调查了一下，发现附近魔爪蛇怪的巢穴里又孵化出许多幼蛇。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]蛇怪生长的周期极快。我想那应该就是贫民街周边魔爪蛇总是泛滥的原因。不过我们势单力薄，根本无法接近。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]如果你们想要帮忙的话，就请再次清理一次那个魔爪蛇窟吧，这样贫民街的压力就会小很多了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]原来如此……我知道了，两位契约者，能请你们帮忙清理掉那个魔爪蛇窟吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"